      "label": "People affected",
      "value": "93,000",
      "hedge": "at least",
      "status": "official_estimate",
      "source_name": "IFRC, reported by UN News, 28 August 2026",
      "note": "Homes, roads, bridges, hydropower and whole stretches of the valley. The figure is the International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies'; David Fisher, its head of delegation in Nepal, gave it, and UN News carried it beside UN OCHA's toll on 28 August. Some outlets frame the same number as Nepal and Tibet together."
    },
    {
